et\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}∗ & 6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{2}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{2}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =[\\begin{aligned}0 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 3\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}3 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={I}_{2}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-102669/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "9b9ef325-2358-5041-8a8d-b459e8ed9f09"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-102669"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "77c867c4-8757-5470-b7a4-85e405eb831e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" :answer/id #uuid "29ddaa95-aefa-5c4e-9d21-5d3a22240a4f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" :answer/id #uuid "e236ee0f-0944-510a-87e0-e5e688e61385" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer/id #uuid "931c5976-7b9c-5379-9db4-0b022d013be0" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b" :answer/id #uuid "a3374b96-d59e-500d-a5cd-56e1e6dfbe0f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4408eafe-0193-5010-acbd-7591641b4d0f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-11634/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" :answer-field/choices ["q-11634/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" "q-11634/selection/6a87b4860f595a380edef797b2cc43b24d4896fc51da713259b980588721456c" "q-11634/selection/95f63c11f99a5015c1f73558576052145e00c1cfbb1718f78cf554be0ab200f9" "q-11634/selection/df67a18079e3b7b726c109ae1bf07ae161d9f6d37a928c50361c8787d74f7981" "q-11634/selection/5b26512916f768e66a2b0af106e5aa3e2ff7ee012277d9669a26d349c343f77b"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-11634" :question/id #uuid "9ee7649a-0e9f-5e8e-9cba-9546fd564117" :question/math-academy-id "q-11634" :question/problem "Consider the matrices\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}],\\,B=[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 7\\end{aligned}],\\,C=\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nWhich of the following statements are true?\n\n- $AB=BA={I}_{3}$\n- $AC=CA={I}_{3}$\n- $B={A}^{-1}$" :question/worked-solution "- First, we check whether $AB=BA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AB$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & \\ne {I}_{3}.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement I is false. As a result, $B\\ne {A}^{-1}$ and statement III is false too.\n\n- Now, we check whether $AC=CA={I}_{3}.$ Computing $AC$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AC & =\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 7\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nLikewise, computing $CA$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}CA & =\\frac{1}{5}[\\begin{aligned}-3 & 1 & 8 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}-1 & 3 & 2 \\\\ 2 & 1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & ={I}_{3}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, statement II is true. \nTherefore, the correct answer is \"II only\"." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-11634/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "a75c67e5-3469-5730-9181-54df4ec6d5b2"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-11634"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-149833/selection/1f1f2fe9df6485d5cdc7916416b2f79699d874348406e639d5daec02cb2e57e6" :answer/id #uuid "18b51e14-8e75-55c3-a6e9-df883fc3875b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "II and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149833/selection/93198c2e65472148f49c73a47d70892e6efd0b46acbb489ee2afeea42a4a8c25" :answer/id #uuid "f9e47f33-aa4b-5a47-9315-0e1ed3de4017" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "None" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-149833/selection/431472f1dab61ef54de031c09a96fb6a21dc69c8bc09f12797d1d686e8c9e8e6" :answer/id #uuid "5f743b8f-b08f-5683-92b0-541b4d3b53f2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "I and III only" :db/ensure [:answer/v